  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/845/521/world-trick-iii.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"548\" height=\"63\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">在這張令人興奮的Minecraft地圖中測試你的跳躍技巧！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">你必須從高處跳下並完美降落在水桶中，以完成每個任務並提升你的跳躍能力。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">準備好接受挑戰並展示你的跳躍技巧了嗎？</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">踏入這張地圖，看看你能走多遠！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/845/522/levels.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"263\" height=\"63\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/845/531/map.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1001\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/845/533/map3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1001\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/845/534/map4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1001\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/845/524/instruction.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"467\" height=\"63\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Sg59iiqSb-8?si=Br3B-hxfrWZ0omlj\" height=\"314\" width=\"560\"></iframe></span></p>",
